WEBVTT

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:15.170
All right.

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:23.550
Yu Narukami
Forever

00:00:23.050 --> 00:00:24.050
I told you!

00:00:24.050 --> 00:00:26.680
You're not supposed to come
near this kitchen, remember?

00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:27.680
Why not?

00:00:27.680 --> 00:00:29.600
We were just trying to help!

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:30.810
Leave the seasoning to me!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:33.140
That's the number one dead zone!

00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:37.440
What?

00:00:47.450 --> 00:00:49.830
Is that all I need to pick up?

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:54.540
Sorry about that... asking you
to go out on our account.

00:00:54.540 --> 00:00:56.290
Oh, I don't mind.

00:00:56.290 --> 00:01:00.800
Besides, Nanako might burst into tears
if she's cooped up in the house.

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:02.340
I wouldn't cry!

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:04.260
Let's go.

00:01:04.260 --> 00:01:05.340
Okay!

00:01:10.220 --> 00:01:11.560
Is something the matter?

00:01:16.310 --> 00:01:17.860
Yu, I...

00:01:17.860 --> 00:01:19.650
Sensei...

00:01:19.650 --> 00:01:20.980
Will you write on this?

00:01:23.650 --> 00:01:24.780
What is this?

00:01:24.240 --> 00:01:25.990
Time Capsule

00:01:24.780 --> 00:01:25.990
Ta-da!

00:01:26.490 --> 00:01:27.740
Golden...

00:01:27.740 --> 00:01:32.450
You see, I thought we'd all write down
our wishes and bury it in the ground.

00:01:32.450 --> 00:01:36.290
And then much, much, much later,
we're gonna dig it up again!

00:01:36.290 --> 00:01:38.670
That is the so-called time capsule!

00:01:38.670 --> 00:01:41.460
How did you find out about it?

00:01:41.670 --> 00:01:44.590
Here! One for Marie-chan, too.

00:01:46.470 --> 00:01:48.600
Write down... my wish?

00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:49.350
Yeah!

00:01:52.440 --> 00:01:56.940
I don't know. I can't write
something like that right now...

00:01:57.400 --> 00:02:00.440
You can give it a good, long think!

00:02:02.690 --> 00:02:04.190
A wish, huh?

00:02:12.160 --> 00:02:14.080
Marie, did you write yours?

00:02:14.370 --> 00:02:16.000
D-Don't look at it, okay?

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:20.590
I-I-It's not like I wrote down a wish
or anything! It's not a poem, either!

00:02:20.590 --> 00:02:22.880
Dummy! I hate you!
Peeping Tom! You suck!

00:02:22.880 --> 00:02:25.920
I swear, right to the very end
you try to read what I've written...

00:02:25.920 --> 00:02:29.010
Jeez, why don't you
go back to the city already?

00:02:33.470 --> 00:02:38.400
I can't believe it. That you're not
gonna be here anymore.

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:42.190
Me neither. It hasn't
sunk in for some reason.

00:02:42.190 --> 00:02:44.820
It just feels way too natural
for me to be here...

00:02:45.150 --> 00:02:46.240
And besides...

00:02:46.240 --> 00:02:48.490
...you have unfinished business?

00:02:50.870 --> 00:02:51.740
How did you...?

00:02:51.870 --> 00:02:53.370
I can tell.

00:02:53.370 --> 00:02:55.500
Why wouldn't I be able to tell?

00:02:58.210 --> 00:03:00.920
I wonder what that Midnight
Channel was all about?

00:03:00.920 --> 00:03:02.670
And this power.

00:03:02.670 --> 00:03:05.760
How come I was able to use
my Persona from the start?

00:03:08.930 --> 00:03:10.050
One more push...

00:03:12.350 --> 00:03:13.850
Just one more push, and...

00:03:16.680 --> 00:03:18.850
I think I can get
a grasp on something...

00:03:21.770 --> 00:03:23.230
I see.

00:03:23.570 --> 00:03:25.860
So you want to find out the truth.

00:03:40.040 --> 00:03:43.130
Hey, it's starting to rain.
Should we go in?

00:03:43.880 --> 00:03:45.050
What do you think you're doing?

00:03:45.050 --> 00:03:46.460
What? What's the problem?

00:03:46.460 --> 00:03:49.340
All I did was add a secret ingredient!

00:03:50.260 --> 00:03:51.760
I'm gonna give him a hand.

00:03:52.340 --> 00:03:53.640
Hey, me too.

00:04:00.810 --> 00:04:01.640
Marie!

00:04:08.320 --> 00:04:10.650
What's... going on?

00:04:11.490 --> 00:04:14.450
Would you like to
peer into my memories?

00:04:15.450 --> 00:04:16.910
Are you okay, Marie?

00:04:22.120 --> 00:04:23.330
What's wrong...

00:04:24.750 --> 00:04:26.040
Marie?

00:04:29.630 --> 00:04:31.930
That one was pretty huge, huh?

00:04:35.760 --> 00:04:38.430
Who... are you?

00:04:40.980 --> 00:04:42.730
My name is Izanami.

00:04:44.770 --> 00:04:46.230
What did you do to Marie?

00:04:46.730 --> 00:04:49.070
You are mistaken.

00:04:49.070 --> 00:04:55.990
The one who forgot her place and interfered
with me is this one, the one you call Marie.

00:04:57.490 --> 00:05:00.700
Had she only wandered aimlessly,
I would've left her alone...

00:05:00.700 --> 00:05:02.870
Do you really want to be
annihilated so badly?

00:05:02.870 --> 00:05:04.420
Stop it!

00:05:05.500 --> 00:05:07.250
Get... out...

00:05:07.670 --> 00:05:09.670
I... am...

00:05:10.130 --> 00:05:11.210
Marie!

00:05:11.210 --> 00:05:13.550
So you choose to resist?

00:05:14.510 --> 00:05:20.850
Then that hope you cling to.
I'm going to test its value.

00:05:21.180 --> 00:05:25.150
Along with the truth,
I'll be waiting for you.

00:05:26.230 --> 00:05:27.360
Marie!

00:05:27.650 --> 00:05:28.400
Marie-chan!

00:05:28.690 --> 00:05:29.650
Marie-chan!

00:05:29.650 --> 00:05:30.900
What on earth is...

00:05:30.230 --> 00:05:31.990
What's going on?

00:05:31.990 --> 00:05:33.150
Marie...

00:05:36.700 --> 00:05:37.660
Yu...

00:05:39.200 --> 00:05:41.080
Wh-What's happening?

00:05:41.910 --> 00:05:42.910
Marie-chan!

00:05:43.540 --> 00:05:44.410
Marie!

00:05:48.500 --> 00:05:49.880
This is...

00:05:49.880 --> 00:05:53.300
You think that the one
we just saw is doing this?

00:05:54.590 --> 00:05:57.930
Marie, I'm going to
save you right now...

00:06:21.280 --> 00:06:24.000
So you've reached it.

00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:27.960
The great existence that
became the start of it all.

00:06:34.670 --> 00:06:36.090
All right!

00:06:35.130 --> 00:06:37.180
Awesome, Senpai!

00:06:37.180 --> 00:06:38.220
Finish him off!

00:06:38.510 --> 00:06:39.800
I'm ending this now!

00:06:39.800 --> 00:06:42.180
But please be cautious.

00:06:42.180 --> 00:06:47.190
Whether defeating that entity will
truly lead to an overall resolution...

00:06:47.190 --> 00:06:49.980
I cannot be sure myself.

00:06:54.030 --> 00:06:54.900
No!

00:06:54.900 --> 00:06:55.860
Yu!

00:06:58.030 --> 00:06:59.490
What's going on here?

00:06:59.490 --> 00:07:01.740
Let go of us, dammit!

00:07:01.740 --> 00:07:03.240
Help!

00:07:03.660 --> 00:07:04.620
You guys!

00:07:04.790 --> 00:07:06.660
No!

00:07:06.660 --> 00:07:08.000
We're sinking!

00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:09.420
Save us, Senpai!

00:07:09.420 --> 00:07:10.330
Dammit!

00:07:13.340 --> 00:07:14.460
Yu...

00:07:32.940 --> 00:07:35.320
Why would... Marie...

00:07:35.860 --> 00:07:39.400
So you're seeing that one in my place.

00:07:39.740 --> 00:07:42.320
That's just not feasible.

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:45.580
What do you mean?

00:07:46.330 --> 00:07:48.960
The one you call Marie...

00:07:49.210 --> 00:07:52.460
She was once a part of me.

00:07:54.500 --> 00:07:57.800
Originally one within me.

00:07:58.630 --> 00:08:00.930
I am called Izanami-no-Mikoto.

00:08:02.800 --> 00:08:07.220
You're lying... You and
Marie couldn't have been one...

00:08:07.810 --> 00:08:11.690
That is what you've all been seeking...

00:08:11.690 --> 00:08:12.980
The truth.

00:08:13.100 --> 00:08:15.770
No matter what you say, Marie is Marie!

00:08:15.770 --> 00:08:17.980
She's our precious friend!

00:08:18.940 --> 00:08:23.280
The truth... that's
what you wanted, right?

00:08:23.780 --> 00:08:27.490
Why people stopped
seeking the truth...

00:08:27.490 --> 00:08:32.750
Because they found out that the truth would
hurt themselves and those around them.

00:08:33.580 --> 00:08:36.000
You must know this yourself.

00:08:36.250 --> 00:08:41.510
How painful it is to seek the truth,
how much it hurts others.

00:08:42.130 --> 00:08:47.760
And now, your actions are
about to erase her existence.

00:08:48.010 --> 00:08:50.520
You're the one who will erase her...

00:09:04.030 --> 00:09:06.280
If you want to share your life with her,

00:09:06.280 --> 00:09:08.830
you have a choice.

00:09:10.330 --> 00:09:15.040
Shield your eyes from the truth,
and give yourself up to a gentle lie.

00:09:15.830 --> 00:09:17.500
A gentle...

00:09:17.840 --> 00:09:19.050
lie...

00:09:32.020 --> 00:09:37.150
People only see what they want to see,
and believe only what they want to believe.

00:09:45.780 --> 00:09:49.580
A world covered in fog is
what the people wish for,

00:09:50.540 --> 00:09:52.580
an element of hope...

00:09:52.950 --> 00:09:57.290
Even with those things,
you couldn't escape from humanity...

00:10:01.710 --> 00:10:04.340
How pitiful...

00:10:20.320 --> 00:10:21.940
<i>I don't want it...</i>

00:10:22.440 --> 00:10:25.740
<i>If it means losing my precious friend...</i>

00:10:25.740 --> 00:10:27.360
<i>I don't want the truth...</i>

00:10:31.280 --> 00:10:33.200
I've seen enough.

00:10:33.200 --> 00:10:36.410
I'm bringing the car around.
Nanako, watch over her.

00:10:36.410 --> 00:10:37.710
Okay...

00:10:39.040 --> 00:10:40.420
I've got to go...

00:10:41.880 --> 00:10:43.710
Big Sis Marie...

00:10:44.050 --> 00:10:45.260
Here's some water...

00:10:46.510 --> 00:10:47.760
Huh?

00:10:56.310 --> 00:10:57.520
That won't do.

00:10:58.310 --> 00:11:00.520
You can't fall in a place like this.

00:11:01.650 --> 00:11:02.520
Marie...

00:11:02.940 --> 00:11:06.610
Right now you've got to
stop her... Stop Izanami.

00:11:06.610 --> 00:11:10.030
This town will be covered
in fog again eventually.

00:11:10.030 --> 00:11:11.530
No...

00:11:11.530 --> 00:11:15.540
Not just this town. One day
that fog will cover the world...

00:11:16.830 --> 00:11:21.290
So Yu... Your wish...

00:11:21.630 --> 00:11:26.550
Only the truth will defeat Izanami,
and become a light that will lift the fog.

00:11:26.880 --> 00:11:29.800
No good... If that happens,
what'll become of you?

00:11:30.430 --> 00:11:31.970
It's all right.

00:11:31.970 --> 00:11:34.470
It's not like I'm going to disappear.

00:11:34.470 --> 00:11:36.430
I'm just going to become one.

00:11:36.430 --> 00:11:38.100
Become one?

00:11:38.100 --> 00:11:42.400
Someone who grants everyone's
wishes and protects the people...

00:11:42.400 --> 00:11:44.820
I'm going to become
Izanagi-no-Mikoto.

00:11:46.780 --> 00:11:47.940
Wait...

00:11:48.820 --> 00:11:50.950
Then what about the Marie right now?

00:11:50.950 --> 00:11:55.990
Well, I'm going to become a god.
Who I've been till now will vanish.

00:11:57.830 --> 00:11:58.830
Why...

00:12:00.460 --> 00:12:02.330
...are you smiling?

00:12:02.880 --> 00:12:06.170
You won't be able to be
with us all, you know!

00:12:06.170 --> 00:12:09.090
But it's not something to be sad about.

00:12:10.010 --> 00:12:14.350
I'm going to become one with Izanami,
and turn into something even bigger.

00:12:15.390 --> 00:12:19.350
Someone who protects
this town, and all of you...

00:12:19.350 --> 00:12:20.690
that's who I'm gonna be.

00:12:20.690 --> 00:12:23.360
But... You...

00:12:25.190 --> 00:12:30.030
Yu... I'm really glad
that I got to meet you all.

00:12:30.650 --> 00:12:35.910
It was so much fun... I was
just bursting... with happiness.

00:12:36.530 --> 00:12:40.620
So I want to go on protecting you all...

00:12:41.120 --> 00:12:44.080
You guys, who turned me into me.

00:12:45.540 --> 00:12:48.590
That's what I wish for.

00:12:51.010 --> 00:12:52.340
Hey, Yu...

00:12:52.840 --> 00:12:54.890
What do you wish for?

00:12:57.640 --> 00:13:02.230
Show me what humans are
capable of to the end... Yu.

00:13:03.600 --> 00:13:04.980
Right...

00:13:04.980 --> 00:13:07.360
I'm not gonna hesitate anymore.

00:13:07.360 --> 00:13:08.610
I...

00:13:08.980 --> 00:13:10.780
My wish is...

00:13:19.160 --> 00:13:21.660
Ah... Still resisting?

00:13:30.460 --> 00:13:31.630
What?

00:13:42.180 --> 00:13:46.020
It's human nature to wish
for a lie... So why aren't you?

00:13:46.350 --> 00:13:52.320
You're wrong. It's not a world
covered in fog that they all desire...

00:13:53.740 --> 00:13:54.900
Persona!

00:14:11.880 --> 00:14:14.010
With such power as this...

00:14:15.180 --> 00:14:16.470
This is...

00:14:16.470 --> 00:14:20.100
It's not as if my body was
starting to disappear.

00:14:20.560 --> 00:14:23.270
You and I were just
trying to become one.

00:14:23.270 --> 00:14:24.600
What?

00:14:24.600 --> 00:14:27.560
You exist to grant the people's wishes.

00:14:27.560 --> 00:14:29.900
I exist to protect them.

00:14:29.900 --> 00:14:34.190
Because we had two conflicting
goals, we split into two.

00:14:34.530 --> 00:14:35.490
That's right.

00:14:35.490 --> 00:14:38.950
And an arrogant wish called "truth"
is what will hurt humankind.

00:14:38.950 --> 00:14:40.580
That's not true.

00:14:40.830 --> 00:14:43.450
Yu's wish isn't his alone.

00:14:43.950 --> 00:14:48.210
This wish called truth will eventually
lift the fog in everybody's heart,

00:14:48.830 --> 00:14:52.880
and his wish will turn into
a light inside their hearts.

00:14:52.880 --> 00:14:55.220
His wish will protect them all.

00:14:56.590 --> 00:14:59.720
His wish will make us all one!

00:15:00.140 --> 00:15:01.930
I'll destroy such a thing!

00:15:08.440 --> 00:15:12.610
Just one more time...
believe in humanity's wish...

00:15:42.100 --> 00:15:45.020
Right now, we became one.

00:15:45.850 --> 00:15:50.650
Now I can protect the people
and grant their wishes.

00:15:51.150 --> 00:15:54.480
Once again, I can walk the path of man.

00:15:55.280 --> 00:15:57.150
It's all thanks to you.

00:15:57.820 --> 00:15:59.360
I see...

00:16:00.110 --> 00:16:01.660
From now on,

00:16:01.660 --> 00:16:03.530
I'm going to protect them...

00:16:03.530 --> 00:16:06.240
This town, all of you...

00:16:06.490 --> 00:16:08.540
Forever and ever...

00:16:09.960 --> 00:16:11.040
Yes, you are...

00:16:14.210 --> 00:16:16.050
Thanks, Yu.

00:16:18.130 --> 00:16:21.720
I'll always be near you.

00:16:32.850 --> 00:16:35.860
Where could she have
gone in that condition?

00:16:35.860 --> 00:16:37.070
Dad...

00:16:37.070 --> 00:16:40.820
<i>I wish we could
stay together forever</i>

00:16:37.610 --> 00:16:39.740
This was on the floor.

00:16:47.450 --> 00:16:49.080
Senpai...

00:17:47.470 --> 00:17:48.810
<i>Hello?</i>

00:17:48.810 --> 00:17:51.980
Uncle, it's Yu. It's been a long time.

00:17:51.980 --> 00:17:54.640
<i>Huh, so it's you?</i>

00:17:54.640 --> 00:17:56.100
I just got here.

00:17:56.100 --> 00:17:58.520
<i>Come to think of it, today's
the day you're coming, huh?</i>

00:17:58.520 --> 00:18:00.110
<i>I totally forgot.</i>

00:18:00.610 --> 00:18:04.240
<i>I'm busy right now, so
I don't think I can pick you up.</i>

00:18:04.240 --> 00:18:07.070
<i>The house is locked up, so
you won't be able to get in.</i>

00:18:07.070 --> 00:18:08.330
Is that right?

00:18:08.330 --> 00:18:10.200
<i>Sorry, but I don't know what to tell you.</i>

00:18:10.200 --> 00:18:13.500
<i>Hang out with your buddies
or something. Later!</i>

00:18:22.380 --> 00:18:23.340
Not picking up.

00:18:42.400 --> 00:18:45.490
Dumbass, don't push!
You'll blow our cover!

00:18:45.490 --> 00:18:47.530
It's your fault for being
a slowpoke, Yosuke!

00:18:47.530 --> 00:18:48.780
A super-slowpoke!

00:18:48.780 --> 00:18:51.120
Why, you... Keep your voice down!

00:18:51.120 --> 00:18:51.830
Yosuke?

00:18:51.830 --> 00:18:54.080
Come on, let's do this
before we're caught!

00:18:54.080 --> 00:18:56.500
We're jumping out
on a count of 1, 2, 3, 4!

00:18:56.500 --> 00:18:58.750
What do you mean 4? It should be 3!

00:18:57.580 --> 00:18:58.750
You there?

00:18:58.750 --> 00:19:00.630
You really are a nit-picker.

00:19:00.920 --> 00:19:04.630
Oh, shut up. Come on, let's go!

00:19:04.630 --> 00:19:06.220
Three, two...

00:19:11.140 --> 00:19:12.390
Long time no see.

00:19:12.720 --> 00:19:14.430
Long time no see...

00:19:15.390 --> 00:19:16.140
You surprised me.

00:19:16.140 --> 00:19:18.520
You don't have to be nice to us!

00:19:18.850 --> 00:19:20.440
Oh, jeez!

00:19:20.440 --> 00:19:22.440
What are you doing?

00:19:21.150 --> 00:19:23.150
Senpai!

00:19:23.860 --> 00:19:24.650
You guys!

00:19:24.650 --> 00:19:28.150
Senpai, how've you been?
Did you miss me?

00:19:28.490 --> 00:19:31.240
How do I look after all this time?
Do I seem different?

00:19:31.240 --> 00:19:33.200
Am I piercing your heart?

00:19:31.870 --> 00:19:34.160
Looks like he was attacked by a bear.

00:19:34.160 --> 00:19:35.040
Now you notice?

00:19:35.040 --> 00:19:37.410
What was the punchline, exactly?

00:19:37.870 --> 00:19:39.670
I don't know what to say...

00:19:40.040 --> 00:19:41.210
You've all changed.

00:19:41.210 --> 00:19:43.040
Why did you say that
looking right at me?

00:19:43.040 --> 00:19:45.300
Oh, hey, it's gonna be all right.

00:19:45.300 --> 00:19:46.670
Don't try to cheer me up!

00:19:46.920 --> 00:19:51.680
Don't worry, we've all
changed in little ways.

00:19:51.680 --> 00:19:53.300
But Kanji...

00:19:55.850 --> 00:19:57.890
What the hell? All right, then!

00:19:57.890 --> 00:19:59.940
Just go back to the way
it was before, right?

00:19:58.850 --> 00:19:59.940
Now, now...

00:20:03.190 --> 00:20:05.440
Sorry about our conversation earlier.

00:20:05.820 --> 00:20:09.610
They asked me to help
so they could surprise you.

00:20:09.610 --> 00:20:10.820
No wonder.

00:20:10.820 --> 00:20:12.990
So? Did it work?

00:20:12.990 --> 00:20:15.910
W-Well, in a way...

00:20:16.830 --> 00:20:18.330
I'm home!

00:20:21.620 --> 00:20:23.210
Big Bro!

00:20:24.750 --> 00:20:26.090
Big Bro!

00:20:28.010 --> 00:20:29.130
Long time no see.

00:20:29.130 --> 00:20:30.380
How've you been?

00:20:30.680 --> 00:20:33.930
She's been counting
the days till you got here,

00:20:33.930 --> 00:20:36.430
but she had lessons all day today.

00:20:36.430 --> 00:20:39.930
You know what?
I'm taking piano lessons now.

00:20:39.930 --> 00:20:41.810
Listen to me play, Big Bro!

00:20:41.810 --> 00:20:43.520
Sure! Of course I will.

00:20:43.520 --> 00:20:47.400
Somehow it feels like we've
gone back in time to last year.

00:20:47.400 --> 00:20:49.360
Great memories!

00:20:50.610 --> 00:20:53.570
Nanako, it'll be on soon.

00:20:53.570 --> 00:20:55.870
Really? I'm gonna turn on the TV!

00:20:55.870 --> 00:20:59.870
Up Next: How is the weather going to be?

00:20:56.530 --> 00:20:58.700
<i>And now, the weather.</i>

00:20:59.080 --> 00:21:02.420
<i>It looks like we'll have this pleasant
sunny weather for the rest of the day,</i>

00:21:02.420 --> 00:21:04.380
<i>but what about
tomorrow and beyond?</i>

00:21:04.960 --> 00:21:06.880
<i>What do you have for us, Ms. Kusumi?</i>

00:21:06.880 --> 00:21:10.630
Weather Forecast

00:21:07.590 --> 00:21:10.630
<i>Hello, hello! I'm Mariko Kusumi.</i>

00:21:11.630 --> 00:21:15.640
Yay, it's Marie-chan!
I adore Marie-chan!

00:21:15.890 --> 00:21:18.470
She's a favorite of Nanako's lately.

00:21:18.470 --> 00:21:20.560
She never misses a report.

00:21:20.930 --> 00:21:24.150
I was worried about her that day,
but she seems to be doing fine.

00:21:24.150 --> 00:21:28.530
<i>Um, till yesterday,
we had nothing but rain.</i>

00:21:28.530 --> 00:21:31.030
<i>So I've decided to make it
sunny starting today.</i>

00:21:31.030 --> 00:21:35.780
<i>Well, after all that rain, we probably won't have to
worry about water shortages this summer.</i>

00:21:35.780 --> 00:21:40.120
<i>And besides, since he's here now,
rain's just out of the question.</i>

00:21:40.370 --> 00:21:42.790
<i>So I'm gonna keep it
sunny for a while.</i>

00:21:42.790 --> 00:21:45.960
<i>Oh, but if it gets too hot,
I will make it rain.</i>

00:21:45.960 --> 00:21:49.210
<i>Just give me a heads-up
or something right away.</i>

00:21:49.210 --> 00:21:51.170
<i>For him, yes...</i>

00:21:51.460 --> 00:21:54.720
Marie-chan decides what the weather's
gonna be like tomorrow, right?

00:21:54.720 --> 00:21:57.350
When Marie-chan says it's
gonna be sunny, it's always sunny!

00:21:57.350 --> 00:22:01.180
I-I wonder what would
happen in this kid's case...?

00:22:01.560 --> 00:22:04.980
<i>Oh, and today I have
a personal message.</i>

00:22:07.860 --> 00:22:10.650
<i>I'm doing quite well.</i>

00:22:10.650 --> 00:22:13.450
<i>Yu, I love you!</i>

00:22:13.650 --> 00:22:15.490
What?

00:22:15.490 --> 00:22:16.740
Was that...

00:22:16.740 --> 00:22:18.700
...a confession of love?

00:22:18.910 --> 00:22:21.790
She's gonna receive
a lot of complaints...

00:22:21.790 --> 00:22:24.210
Young people...

00:22:24.370 --> 00:22:26.830
<i>All right, please sign off
with your usual...</i>

00:22:26.830 --> 00:22:31.210
<i>I hope you all have
a goooood day tomorrow!</i>

00:22:31.710 --> 00:22:33.720
Have a goooood day!

00:22:34.010 --> 00:22:36.970
I hear that phrase is really popular.

00:22:36.970 --> 00:22:40.060
When you hear it, you mysteriously
start to feel cheerful, it seems.

00:22:39.720 --> 00:22:42.180
TIME CAPSULE

00:22:40.060 --> 00:22:41.890
Ta-da!

00:22:42.180 --> 00:22:43.730
What do you think this is?

00:22:43.730 --> 00:22:45.520
The time capsule!

00:22:44.730 --> 00:22:46.020
Golden...

00:22:45.520 --> 00:22:47.350
You dug it up already?

00:22:47.350 --> 00:22:50.940
Yeah! I figured if we're gonna
open it, why not now?

00:22:50.940 --> 00:22:52.860
No, wait, isn't it too soon?

00:22:52.860 --> 00:22:56.150
Normally you're supposed to
open these up decades later!

00:22:56.150 --> 00:22:58.620
It hasn't even been six months yet.

00:22:58.620 --> 00:23:00.080
Jeez...

00:23:00.080 --> 00:23:03.120
Let's not sweat the small stuff -
let's just open it!

00:23:03.120 --> 00:23:05.370
No way am I gonna let you!

00:23:07.330 --> 00:23:08.460
Whoa...

00:23:08.460 --> 00:23:09.710
Nice catch, Chie!

00:23:09.710 --> 00:23:12.300
Come on! What are you doing?

00:23:14.090 --> 00:23:19.640
Hold on, Nanako, wasn't there something
you wanted to say when Yu came home?

00:23:19.640 --> 00:23:21.470
Y-Yes...

00:23:23.770 --> 00:23:25.100
Um...

00:23:26.890 --> 00:23:27.890
Oh, I get it!

00:23:29.980 --> 00:23:31.610
I see.

00:23:34.980 --> 00:23:35.990
...that's the deal.

00:23:35.990 --> 00:23:36.740
- Okay!
- Let's do it!

00:23:36.740 --> 00:23:37.570
- Yes!
- All right?

00:23:37.570 --> 00:23:38.660
- Very well.
- Roger!

00:23:41.450 --> 00:23:43.660
All right. Three, two...

00:23:45.120 --> 00:23:46.160
Yu...

00:23:46.160 --> 00:23:48.160
- Welcome home!
- Long time no see!

00:23:48.580 --> 00:23:50.540
Kanji! You're supposed to
say "Welcome home!"

00:23:50.540 --> 00:23:52.420
Why can't we ever be in sync?

00:23:52.420 --> 00:23:54.500
Kanji, you really are...

00:23:54.500 --> 00:23:56.420
Well, it's not anything new, is it?

00:23:56.420 --> 00:23:59.840
Man, you really haven't changed at all!

00:23:59.840 --> 00:24:01.010
You guys...

00:24:03.260 --> 00:24:04.430
I'm home.

00:24:04.850 --> 00:24:06.100
All right!

00:24:06.100 --> 00:24:08.390
Let's all dig in, then, partner!

00:24:07.430 --> 00:24:15.280
<i>I wish we could
stay together forever</i>

00:24:08.390 --> 00:24:09.440
Right!
